{"title":"hello from marseille","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/hello-from-marseille","date":1783335780000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/cae002de-f55e-4b9d-9ee1-38e0bf58a147/vp-edited1.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"3887\" height=\"2896\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/cae002de-f55e-4b9d-9ee1-38e0bf58a147/vp-edited1.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/cae002de-f55e-4b9d-9ee1-38e0bf58a147/vp-edited1.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/cae002de-f55e-4b9d-9ee1-38e0bf58a147/vp-edited1.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/cae002de-f55e-4b9d-9ee1-38e0bf58a147/vp-edited1.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/cae002de-f55e-4b9d-9ee1-38e0bf58a147/vp-edited1.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/cae002de-f55e-4b9d-9ee1-38e0bf58a147/vp-edited1.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/cae002de-f55e-4b9d-9ee1-38e0bf58a147/vp-edited1.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>visit my <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">sketchbook</a> | <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/marseille\" target=\"_blank\">marseille</a> </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n \n\n\n  <p>hello there.</p><p>after weeks and months of being thrown around inside an excruciatingly painful time warp, I’ve found a sweaty, sticky, slow landing in marseille for the summer.</p><p>here’s my first drawing I painted in my sketchbook, last night, of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Port_of_Marseille\" target=\"_blank\">le vieux port</a>, at sunset, from one of the first days when I arrived. I went for ice cream with my friend, and we stood here to listen to the street music and watch the remnants of the sunset... </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fb8c0271-dc98-4002-adf5-1ff28c097837/vieuxport-1.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fb8c0271-dc98-4002-adf5-1ff28c097837/vieuxport-1.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fb8c0271-dc98-4002-adf5-1ff28c097837/vieuxport-1.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fb8c0271-dc98-4002-adf5-1ff28c097837/vieuxport-1.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fb8c0271-dc98-4002-adf5-1ff28c097837/vieuxport-1.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fb8c0271-dc98-4002-adf5-1ff28c097837/vieuxport-1.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fb8c0271-dc98-4002-adf5-1ff28c097837/vieuxport-1.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fb8c0271-dc98-4002-adf5-1ff28c097837/vieuxport-1.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/36257237-c143-45ac-baa4-ef3f6f9f127f/vieuxport-photo.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/36257237-c143-45ac-baa4-ef3f6f9f127f/vieuxport-photo.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/36257237-c143-45ac-baa4-ef3f6f9f127f/vieuxport-photo.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/36257237-c143-45ac-baa4-ef3f6f9f127f/vieuxport-photo.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/36257237-c143-45ac-baa4-ef3f6f9f127f/vieuxport-photo.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/36257237-c143-45ac-baa4-ef3f6f9f127f/vieuxport-photo.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/36257237-c143-45ac-baa4-ef3f6f9f127f/vieuxport-photo.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/36257237-c143-45ac-baa4-ef3f6f9f127f/vieuxport-photo.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr />\n \n\n\n  <p>of course, all boats and water remind me of <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/istanbul\">istanbul</a>, of sitting by the ferry docks along the bosphorus at sunset. of course it was painful to look at this without thinking of that other world, and all that I’ve loved inside them, and lost. </p><p>but, I’m here now. and I’m planning to be here for another 5 weeks. I’ve decided to buy a separate sketchbook for Marseille - <em>a place diary</em>, so to speak — and slowly fulfill my intentions of making more tangible/analog art — in book form. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7358f970-1c45-4de9-ad3b-28a870a8a333/vp-edited2.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7358f970-1c45-4de9-ad3b-28a870a8a333/vp-edited2.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7358f970-1c45-4de9-ad3b-28a870a8a333/vp-edited2.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7358f970-1c45-4de9-ad3b-28a870a8a333/vp-edited2.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7358f970-1c45-4de9-ad3b-28a870a8a333/vp-edited2.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7358f970-1c45-4de9-ad3b-28a870a8a333/vp-edited2.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7358f970-1c45-4de9-ad3b-28a870a8a333/vp-edited2.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7358f970-1c45-4de9-ad3b-28a870a8a333/vp-edited2.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr />\n \n\n\n  <p>I’m getting myself excited for this, as it’ll help me practice more <em>seeing</em> and <em>being </em>in this place — rather than just floating in the foggy dark worlds in my head. </p><p>marseille is my port. I’ve been lost at sea, shipwrecked, and now I’ll draw my anchors, my new boat, page by page. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/411e0c1e-24ee-47fd-bec8-3b6c6b50f499/vieuxport-2.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/411e0c1e-24ee-47fd-bec8-3b6c6b50f499/vieuxport-2.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/411e0c1e-24ee-47fd-bec8-3b6c6b50f499/vieuxport-2.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/411e0c1e-24ee-47fd-bec8-3b6c6b50f499/vieuxport-2.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/411e0c1e-24ee-47fd-bec8-3b6c6b50f499/vieuxport-2.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/411e0c1e-24ee-47fd-bec8-3b6c6b50f499/vieuxport-2.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/411e0c1e-24ee-47fd-bec8-3b6c6b50f499/vieuxport-2.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/411e0c1e-24ee-47fd-bec8-3b6c6b50f499/vieuxport-2.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n\n  <p>more <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\">visual</a> work | visit my <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">sketchbook</a> | <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/marseille\" target=\"_blank\">marseille</a> </p>","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"92fa2d2ee7c52075745322ff24790734a0b1e0a0ef0bf87553a6331303627716","category":"Sites"}